{"seq":1,"slug":"scroll-driven-animations","title":"滚动驱动动画：ScrollTimeline、CSS scroll-timeline 与视差效果","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-animation-engineering/advanced/scroll-driven-animations","wordCount":604,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"滚动驱动动画-scrolltimeline-css-scroll-timeline-与视差效果\">滚动驱动动画：ScrollTimeline、CSS scroll-timeline 与视差效果</h1><p>滚动驱动动画将动画进度与页面滚动位置绑定，是近年 Web 动效领域最重要的规范演进。CSS Scroll-Driven Animations 规范（Level 1）于 2023-2024 年在主流浏览器落地，提供了纯 CSS 实现滚动动画的原生能力，同时 WAAPI 也扩展了 <code>ScrollTimeline</code> 和 <code>ViewTimeline</code> 支持 JavaScript 控制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"滚动驱动动画的两种时间线\">滚动驱动动画的两种时间线</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[CSS scroll-timeline / JS ScrollTimeline] --&gt; B[&quot;source: 滚动容器&lt;br/&gt;axis: block/inline&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;动画进度 = 滚动进度&lt;br/&gt;0% → 容器起点&lt;br/&gt;100% → 容器终点&quot;]&#10;    D[CSS view-timeline / JS ViewTimeline] --&gt; E[&quot;subject: 目标元素&lt;br/&gt;进入视口 → 动画开始&lt;br/&gt;离开视口 → 动画结束&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[CSS scroll-timeline / JS ScrollTimeline] --&gt; B[\"source: 滚动容器&lt;br/&gt;axis: block/inline\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"动画进度 = 滚动进度&lt;br/&gt;0% → 容器起点&lt;br/&gt;100% → 容器终点\"]\n    D[CSS view-timeline / JS ViewTimeline] --&gt; E[\"subject: 目标元素&lt;br/&gt;进入视口 → 动画开始&lt;br/&gt;离开视口 → 动画结束\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时间线类型</th>\n<th>绑定对象</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>ScrollTimeline</code></td>\n<td>滚动容器的滚动位置</td>\n<td>进度条、视差背景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ViewTimeline</code></td>\n<td>元素在视口中的可见范围</td>\n<td>入场动画、淡入淡出</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"css-scroll-driven-animations\">CSS Scroll-Driven Animations</h2><h3 id=\"基础-scroll-timeline\">基础：scroll-timeline</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"@keyframes progress-bar {&#10;  from {&#10;    width: 0%;&#10;  }&#10;  to {&#10;    width: 100%;&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;.progress-bar {&#10;  animation: progress-bar linear;&#10;  animation-timeline: scroll(); /* 绑定到最近的滚动祖先 */&#10;  animation-fill-mode: both;&#10;}&#10;&#10;/* scroll() 函数参数 */&#10;/* scroll()                — 最近的滚动容器，block 轴 */&#10;/* scroll(root)            — 根滚动容器（html/body） */&#10;/* scroll(inline)          — 水平滚动 */&#10;/* scroll(nearest block)   — 最近的祖先容器，垂直 */\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@keyframes</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> progress-bar</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    width</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  to</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    width</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.progress-bar</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  animation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: progress-bar </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">linear</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  animation-timeline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">scroll</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 绑定到最近的滚动祖先 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  animation-fill-mode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">both</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* scroll() 函数参数 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* scroll()                — 最近的滚动容器，block 轴 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* scroll(root)            — 根滚动容器（html/body） */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* scroll(inline)          — 水平滚动 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* scroll(nearest block)   — 最近的祖先容器，垂直 */</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"进阶-view-timeline-元素进入视口动画\">进阶：view-timeline（元素进入视口动画）</h3><p><code>view-timeline</code> 以目标元素在滚动容器中的可见性为时间线：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".card {&#10;  animation: fade-up linear both;&#10;  animation-timeline: view();&#10;  animation-range: entry 0% entry 30%;&#10;  /* 元素进入视口的前 30% 完成动画 */&#10;}&#10;&#10;@keyframes fade-up {&#10;  from {&#10;    opacity: 0;&#10;    transform: translateY(40px);&#10;  }&#10;  to {&#10;    opacity: 1;&#10;    transform: translateY(0);&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.card</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  animation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: fade-up </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">linear</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> both</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  animation-timeline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: view();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  animation-range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: entry </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entry </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  /* 元素进入视口的前 30% 完成动画 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@keyframes</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> fade-up</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    opacity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    transform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">translateY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">40</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  to</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    opacity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    transform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">translateY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong><code>animation-range</code> 的取值</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>关键字</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>entry</code></td>\n<td>元素进入视口的阶段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>exit</code></td>\n<td>元素离开视口的阶段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>cover</code></td>\n<td>从元素完全离开视口起点到终点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>contain</code></td>\n<td>从元素完全进入视口到开始离开</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"/* 组合使用 animation-range */&#10;.section-title {&#10;  animation: reveal-title linear both;&#10;  animation-timeline: view();&#10;  animation-range: entry 20% cover 40%;&#10;  /* 在进入视口 20% 到覆盖范围 40% 之间完成动画 */&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 组合使用 animation-range */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.section-title</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  animation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: reveal-title </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">linear</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> both</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  animation-timeline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: view();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  animation-range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: entry </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> cover</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 40</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  /* 在进入视口 20% 到覆盖范围 40% 之间完成动画 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"css-视差效果\">CSS 视差效果</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".parallax-hero {&#10;  position: sticky;&#10;  top: 0;&#10;  height: 100vh;&#10;  overflow: hidden;&#10;}&#10;&#10;.parallax-bg {&#10;  width: 100%;&#10;  height: 130%; /* 比容器高，留出移动空间 */&#10;  animation: parallax-shift linear both;&#10;  animation-timeline: scroll(nearest block);&#10;  animation-range: 0% 100%;&#10;}&#10;&#10;@keyframes parallax-shift {&#10;  from {&#10;    transform: translateY(0);&#10;  }&#10;  to {&#10;    transform: translateY(-30%);&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.parallax-hero</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  position</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sticky</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  top</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E