\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      observer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">unobserve</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(entry.target);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}, observerOptions);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">document.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">querySelectorAll</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.animate-on-scroll'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">forEach</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">el</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  observer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">observe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(el);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>IntersectionObserver vs ScrollTimeline 的选择</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>IntersectionObserver</th>\n<th>CSS Scroll-Driven</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>浏览器支持</td>\n<td>Chrome 58+，全面</td>\n<td>Chrome 115+，Safari 18+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动画精确度</td>\n<td>阈值触发，非连续</td>\n<td>连续进度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>视差效果</td>\n<td>需要 JS 计算</td>\n<td>纯 CSS 可实现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>进度条</td>\n<td>需要 scroll 事件</td>\n<td>天然支持</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>兼容性策略</strong>：2026 年 Scroll-Driven Animations 的全局支持率约 80%。可用 <code>@supports (animation-timeline: scroll())</code> 检测，降级到 IntersectionObserver + CSS 类切换。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>ScrollTimeline</strong>：将动画进度绑定到滚动容器的滚动位置（0% = 容器起点，100% = 容器终点）</li>\n<li><strong>ViewTimeline</strong>：将动画进度绑定到目标元素在视口中的可见性变化</li>\n<li><strong>animation-timeline</strong>：CSS 属性，将 <code>@keyframes</code> 动画绑定到 <code>scroll()</code> 或 <code>view()</code> 时间线</li>\n<li><strong>animation-range</strong>：控制动画在时间线哪个区间内执行（<code>entry</code>/<code>exit</code>/<code>cover</code>/<code>contain</code> + 百分比）</li>\n<li><strong>scrub</strong>：GSAP ScrollTrigger 的滚动联动模式，动画进度与滚动进度实时同步</li>\n<li><strong>IntersectionObserver</strong>：监听元素与视口的交叉状态，是 CSS Scroll-Driven Animations 的降级替代方案</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>CSS Scroll-Driven Animations 规范提供了纯 CSS 实现滚动动画的原生能力，<code>scroll()</code> 和 <code>view()</code> 函数分别对应滚动进度和元素可见性两种时间线。2026 年浏览器支持率约 80%，生产中需配合 IntersectionObserver 降级方案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章导航\">本章导航</h2><ul>\n<li>下一篇：<a href=\"layout-animations\">布局动画</a> — FLIP 技术与 Framer Motion layout</li>\n<li>章节概览：<a href=\"../advanced/\">进阶技术</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"滚动驱动动画：ScrollTimeline、CSS scroll-timeline 与视差效果","id":"滚动驱动动画-scrolltimeline-css-scroll-timeline-与视差效果"},{"level":2,"text":"滚动驱动动画的两种时间线","id":"滚动驱动动画的两种时间线"},{"level":2,"text":"CSS Scroll-Driven Animations","id":"css-scroll-driven-animations"},{"level":3,"text":"基础：scroll-timeline","id":"基础-scroll-timeline"},{"level":3,"text":"进阶：view-timeline（元素进入视口动画）","id":"进阶-view-timeline-元素进入视口动画"},{"level":3,"text":"CSS 视差效果","id":"css-视差效果"},{"level":2,"text":"JavaScript：ScrollTimeline 与 ViewTimeline","id":"javascript-scrolltimeline-与-viewtimeline"},{"level":2,"text":"IntersectionObserver：降级与增强","id":"intersectionobserver-降级与增强"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"本章导航","id":"本章导航"}],"prev":{"title":"弹簧物理动画：react-spring 与 stiffness-damping-mass 模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-animation-engineering/libraries/spring-physics"},"next":{"title":"布局动画：FLIP 技术原理与实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-animation-engineering/advanced/layout-animations"}}